          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach out about sound baths, private sessions, and bookings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1724; --card:#0b1220; --accent:#c7f0e6; --muted:#9fb7b0; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\\n      --radius:14px; --maxw:980px; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071020 0%,#081528 60%);color:var(--accent);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:48px auto;padding:40px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);position:relative;overflow:hidden}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6de7cf,#7fb8ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#04202a}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:26px;line-height:1.05;color:var(--accent)}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}\\n\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n\\n    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:var(--glass);color:var(--accent);font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .submit{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6de7cf,#7fb8ff);color:#04202a;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n\\n    .info{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}\\n    .section{margin-top:18px}\\n\\n    .side{position:relative}\\n    .card-cta{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(127,184,255,0.06),rgba(109,231,207,0.03));color:#001b1a}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:#003033;margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    .testimonials{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .t{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* subtle decorative SVG pattern */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-40px;opacity:0.08;width:520px;height:520px;transform:rotate(12deg);}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .pattern{display:none}\\n      .wrap{margin:24px;padding:20px}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" role=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <!-- Inline SVG pattern for premium texture -->\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7fb8ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.8\\\" />\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6de7cf\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.8\\\" />\\n        </linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 10 L10 0 M10 20 L20 10\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"0.8\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n        </pattern>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p)\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A sound craft in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">1:1 & Private</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Reach out — we listen</div>\\n        <h2>Reserve, inquire, or ask a question</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Send a note to {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} about events, private sessions, accessibility, or venue details. We aim for replies within 48 hours.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel section\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"First & last\\\" required>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"width:160px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" required>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"width:160px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"when\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"when\\\" name=\\\"preferred_date\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. next month\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"type\\\">I am contacting about</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"inquiry_type\\\">\\n                  <option>Group event / open sound bath</option>\\n                  <option>Private 1:1 session</option>\\n                  <option>Couples session</option>\\n                  <option>Corporate / retreat</option>\\n                  <option>Press & collaborations</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"width:140px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"how\\\">How did you hear of us?</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"how\\\" name=\\\"source\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"friend, IG, search\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about your warmth, accessibility needs, or questions...\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"submit\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"small muted section\\\">By submitting, you agree we may contact you about your request. We keep details private.</div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section info panel\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"display:block;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:8px\\\">What to bring</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px 18px;padding:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Yoga mat or blanket</li>\\n            <li>Pillow for head support</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle and open heart</li>\\n          </ul>\\n\\n          <strong style=\\\"display:block;color:var(--accent);margin:8px 0\\\">Flow of the session</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small muted\\\">We begin with gentle grounding, invite intention sharing, move into a 40–60 minute sound journey led by crystal bowls and tuning instruments, and close with soft spoken reflection and space to rehydrate. You may return to movement slowly.</p>\\n\\n          <strong style=\\\"display:block;color:var(--accent);margin:8px 0\\\">Contraindications & safety</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small muted\\\">If you are pregnant, have severe tinnitus, uncontrolled epilepsy, or recent head/neck injuries, please consult your physician and let us know before booking. Sound can be powerful; we adapt sessions for safety.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"side\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card-cta panel\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Next gathering</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;margin-top:6px\\\">{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"meta\\\">At {{VENUE_NAME}} — in {{CITY}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n              <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"submit\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px\\\">Book a spot</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"section testimonials\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"t\\\">\\\"A deep, soft suspension — I slept better that night.\\\" — A.R.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"t\\\">\\\"Thoughtful facilitation and clear intention-setting. Warm welcome.\\\" — M.T.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"shadow-instruments\\\">\\n          <div id=\\\"shadow-instruments\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)\\\">Instruments in our palette</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Expect a curated blend: gong, tuned chimes, breathing cues, and the harmonic drone of the monochord. We temper volume and texture to the room.</div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"section\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:6px\\\">Quick contact</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — facilitated by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} | { {TAGLINE} }</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-right:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\">Privacy</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\">FAQ</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact page and notes\\\\n\\\\nFiles included:\\\\n- contact.html — full contact & inquiry page for the sound bath site.\\\\n- README.md — this file.\\\\n\\\\nPurpose:\\\\nThis chunk provides the contact page for the {{BUSINESS_NAME}} site. It is designed in a minimal_poetic voice with a premium, sensory-forward aesthetic. The page includes:\\\\n- accessible contact form posting to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\\n- \\\"what to bring\\\" guidance, a concise session flow, and a contraindications notice (as required)\\\\n- instrument palette description (unique mix for this page: gong, tuned chimes, monochord)\\\\n- quick contact details using placeholders: {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}\\\\n- next event teaser using {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} and {{VENUE_NAME}}\\\\n\\\\nDesign notes & constraints:\\\\n- Visual richness is created with CSS gradients and an inline SVG pattern (no external images or CDNs).\\\\n- Navigation labels are intentionally varied from other pages (e.g., \\\"Gatherings\\\" vs \\\"Events\\\").\\\\n- Placeholders remain for dynamic population.\\\\n- The form is simple and unobtrusive; adapt the action attribute to your booking endpoint or form handler.\\\\n\\\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\\\n- Colors use high contrast for legibility; the design is responsive.\\\\n- The pattern SVG is decorative (aria-hidden) and positioned nonintrusively.\\\\n\\\\nIntegration tips:\\\\n- Ensure your server or static host rewrites/form handler accepts POST submissions at {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} or change the form action to a processing endpoint.\\\\n- Replace placeholders with real values during build or templating.\\\\n- If you generate the additional pages, be sure to vary headings and instrument lists to meet uniqueness constraints.\\\\n\\\\nEnd of chunk 4.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
